Package: aidia
Title: Adaptive Isolation for DIA - Your Aid for Window Optimization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("KBSI", "Proteomics", , "proteomics@kbsi.re.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: AIDIA (Adaptive Isolation for DIA) aids researchers in optimizing
    Data-Independent Acquisition isolation windows for mass spectrometry.
    Features RT-dependent adaptive m/z range optimization with 6 strategies
    (Greedy, KDE, Quantile, Coverage, Outlier, Smoothing), 3 window modes
    (Variable, Fixed, Staggered), DPPP-based intelligent planning, technical
    replicate consensus handling, and 22-column Thermo Xcalibur-compatible
    method file export. Specifically optimized for Thermo Orbitrap instruments
    (Astral, Exploris, Fusion Lumos).
